    <string name="faq_1_body">Eka xikrini xo nghena, tshindzela \"U honisile phasiwedi?\", nghenisa imeyili ya wena, hlamula xivutiso xa vuhlayiseki kutani u hlawula phasiwedi leyintshwa. Loko akhawunti ya wena yi nga ri na xivutiso xa vuhlayiseki, kombela mulanguteri leswaku a yi seta nakambe.</string>
    <string name="faq_1_title">Ndzi honisile phasiwedi ya mina</string>
    <string name="faq_2_body">Tshindzela buluwa ra + eka ndhawu ya wena, nghenisa nhlokomhaka na nhlamuselo, hlawula xiyenge na nkoka (app yi ta endla xitsundzuxo) u tlhela u tlhanta fayili loko yi pfuna. Endzhaku tshindzela rhumela.</string>
    <string name="faq_2_title">Ndzi rhumela tikiti ku ya hi ndlela yihi?</string>
    <string name="faq_3_body">Minkarhi yi ya hi nkoka: Lowu Tlakukeke tiawara ta 4, Ehenhla tiawara ta 24, Exikarhi tiawara ta 72, Ehansi tiawara ta 120. Omu tikiti leti hundzeke nkarhi ti kombisiwa eka ntlawa wa nseketelo.</string>
    <string name="faq_3_title">Tikiti ra mina ri ta tirhiwa rini?</string>
    <string name="faq_4_body">Sungula xitirhisiwa nakambe, rivala u tlhela u nghena eka netiweke ya Wi-Fi, u antswisa app ya VPN. Loko yi ha tsemeka, rhumela tikiti eka xiyenge xa Netiweke.</string>
    <string name="faq_4_title">Wi-Fi kumbe VPN ya mina yi hambeta yi tsemeka</string>
    <string name="faq_5_body">Yi sungule nakambe, pfala tiapp leti u nga ti tirhisiko, ntshunxa ndhawu ya vuhlayiselo u tlhela u nghenisa swiantswiso. Loko yi ha hlwela, rhumela tikiti ya Hardware kumbe Software.</string>
    <string name="faq_5_title">Khompyuta ya mina yi hlwela</string>
    <string name="faq_6_body">Pfula tikiti eka ndhawu ya wena. Matimu ma kombisa ku cinca ka xiyimo ni ku nyikiwa hinkwako. Loko tikiti ri lulamisiwile, munhu loyi a ri pfuleke a nga nyika tinyeleti ta 1 ku fika eka ta 5.</string>
    <string name="faq_6_title">Ndzi nyika tikiti mavonelo kumbe ndzi vona matimu ya yona ku ya hi ndlela yihi?</string>
